#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:47
#: ea2b1c3392154df18d6811fa13bdeffd
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:49
#: 5095d46f42a8462d9038e142226bd28c
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART8 RCIN pin. All ArduPilot "
"supported unidirectional RC protocols can be input here except PPM. For bi-"
"directional or half-duplex protocols, such as CRSF/ELRS a full UART will "
"have to be used. For example if SERIAL2 (UART5) is used for bi-directional "
"RC, then:"
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART8 RCIN 引脚上。所有 ArduPilot 支持的单向 RC 协议均可输入此处，PPM "
"除外。对于双向或半双工协议（如 CRSF/ELRS），需要使用完整的 UART。例如，如果 SERIAL2（UART5）用于双向 RC，则："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:51
#: 48bcdc82945843fba40814c9c5b2b36d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 必须设为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:52
#: 9ef830f715604d67a2c4015f1f0b43d9
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:53
#: d6da704e0696410fad5266c7c543f7fb
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:54
#: cd6fcc3ba18f45c89e0141e9afc54957
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to Tx and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 Tx，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:55
#: 87a59900fd1045f6b505945c891fb557
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires a Tx connection, in addition to Rx, and "
"automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF/ELRS 除需连接 Rx 外，还需要 Tx 连接，并自动提供数传。将 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:56
#: cfc097cfcad44304a6d583d67634cfcf
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to Tx and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 Tx，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:58
#: 081edfb22fbe407f8a00164bacacc734
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

