#: fa245a43c7e34918ae658d06a896bd75
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled \"MFT-SEMA100\"."
msgstr "此飞控的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的 「MFT-SEMA100」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mft-sema100.rst:129
#: 6b6e5e34d0f94c309b817890ca73d620
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible"
" ground station."
msgstr "该飞控板预装了兼容 ArduPilot 的引导程序，可使用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
